# Classic Halloween — design notes

Resume: `@halloween$` / `$halloween$`. Template id **`classicHalloween`**, name **Classic Halloween** (template title is not translated). Branch `feat/classic-halloween` (not published, not deployed).

## Spec (owner)

| Item | Decision |
|---|---|
| Board | Same classic three-line board as `blackwhite` (`profileId` = `classicBoard`, `identityRail`, `identity-loop` FloqR identity card). **`blackwhite` itself is unchanged.** |
| Emoji | Allowed (`allowEmoji: true`). Letters are uppercased, emoji kept; caps count graphemes so an emoji is one glyph and never split. |
| Background | Dark LED-friendly moonlit graveyard + jack-o'-lanterns: `images/halloween/classic-halloween-2x1.svg` (96×48, 64×32), `-4x3.svg` (64×48 via CSS). Not patron-editable (`backgroundEditable: false`). |
| Finale | At the end of each ShoutOut cycle: a grave rises, several white ghosts burst out and rush toward the viewer, the Reaper rises, bats swarm. |
| Timing | `FLOQRFrameLoop.cycle("halloween-finale", {count: 4})` — 3 board phases + 1 finale phase × 6 s. **No per-template `setInterval` / `setTimeout`.** |
| Reduced motion | `@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)`: animations off, static ghost line-up + Reaper, no bats, board dimmed. |
| Venues / sizes | All clubs (`scope: 'Shared'`, in `SHOUTOUT_STANDARD_TEMPLATE_IDS`, `seasonal: true` so restricted venues still list it). `Is96x48 = Is64x48 = Is64x32 = 1`. |
| Price | **$15.00 = 1500 cents, server-authoritative** (`CLASSIC_HALLOWEEN_PRICE_CENTS` in `functions/commerce-functions.js`). |

