No Firestore `templates/classicHalloween` doc is required: Search uses the packaged catalog and `display-app.js` merges Firestore rows over it.

## Pitfalls

- SVG art must stay valid XML — a stray control character (e.g. U+0014 instead of an em dash) makes the background silently disappear. The test checks for this.
- Do not use `.slice` / HTML `maxlength` on emoji copy (UTF-16 splits emoji); use grapheme helpers.
- Do not give the finale its own timer; it rides `FLOQRFrameLoop`.

